##########################
### Empire Ship Models ###
##########################


#	Model				Section													Built-In Locators

#	Y8			-	Construction Ship										-	Engines + Explosions
#	Sentinal Transport	-	Transport Ship											-	Engines + Explosions
#	Imperial Frighter	-	Colony Ship											-	Engines + Explosions
#	CR90 Science		-	Science Ship											-	Engines + Explosions
#	Gozanti Cruiser		-	Add-On Corvette M1S1 02										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	IPV4			-	Corvette S3 + Corvette M1S1									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Costums Corvette	-	Add-On Corvette M1S1 01										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Costums Escort		-	Add-On Destroyer Bow M3										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Raider			-	Destroyer Bow S3										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Vigil			-	Add-On Destroyer Bow M2S2									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Imperial Nebulon-B	-	Exploration Cruiser Bow L1 + Exploration Cruiser Bow M1S2 + Exploration Cruiser Bow M2		-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Arquitens		-	Destroyer Bow M1S2										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Victory Frigate		-	Add-On Destroyer Bow S5										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Broadside		-	Destroyer Bow L1										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Tonn Falk		-	Add-On Cruiser Mid S2HB 01									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	KDY Escort Carrier	-	Add-On Destroyer Bow S1HB									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Acclamator		-	Battlecruiser Bow M2										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Gladiator		-	Add-On Cruiser Mid S2HB 02									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Twin-Well Immobilizer	-	Cruiser Mid M3											-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Immobilizer 418		-	Cruiser Mid L1M1										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Vindicator		-	Cruiser Mid M2S2 + Cruiser Mid S2HB								-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Victory I		-	Battlecruiser Bow M1S2										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Victory II		-	Battlecruiser Bow L1										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Venator			-	Add-On Battleship Mid S4LHB									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Procursator		-	Battleship Mid M4SHB + Battleship Mid S4LHB		 					-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	ISD Dominator		-	Add-On Battleship Mid M6									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	ISD Conquerer		-	Add-On Battleship Mid XL1M2									-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	ISD I			-	Battleship Mid L2M2										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	ISD II			-	Battleship Mid L3										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Secutor			-	Carrier Bow L1M1S2 + Carrier Bow L2 + Carrier Bow M1S2SHB + Carrier Bow XL1			-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions
#	Alligance		-	Dreadnought Bow XL1 + Dreadnought Bow L2 + Dreadnought Bow L1M1S2 + Dreadnought Bow M1S2SHB	-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)
#	Bellator		-	Titan Mid											-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)
#	Annihilator		-	Juggernaut											-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)
#	Assertor		-	Add-On Flagship Bow T1										-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)
#	Executor		-	Flagship Bow L2 + Flagship Bow M1S2SHB								-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)
#	Eclipse			-	Flagship Bow L1M1S2 + Flagship Bow XL1								-	Engines + Weapons + Explosions (& Detonate)
#	Death Star		-	Coloussus											-	Weapons + Explosions (Detonate Only)


